    <solution><m>P=( 9\text{,}-10 )</m> is obtained by substituting <m>x=9</m> in <m>\mathbf{F}</m>, that is,
<me>\mathbf{F} ( 9,-10 )= \left\lt 9^2,9 \right&gt; = \left\lt  81,9 \right&gt;</me>
Similarly,
<me>\mathbf{F} ( -9,1 )= \left\lt  {( -9 )}^2,-9 \right&gt; = \left\lt  81,-9\right&gt;</me>
